      "intent": "answer",
      "answer": "Ally is a not-for-profit platform that helps people who support others—counsellors, volunteers, teachers and peers—practise hard conversations and get support on the job. It includes tools such as Skills Lab (roleplay with virtual clients by voice or text, with an AI supervisor and a debrief) and Ally Assist (a scribe that transcribes real sessions and drafts notes), plus courses, cases and learning pathways.",
